FILE:      T22_theta_A_splithalf.csv
SHA256:    efe8237cc19fc13cc257c22162cddd0b02e4b39d40b0f43509802f40fc32ed7b
PRODUCER:  S24_reliability.R
INPUTS:
  data/S5R_bhat.rds: d46910ef55f0a22018baf8bd218dac5548bde98150d798ad85aa1914af8d12d8
  data/S1R_ppml.rds: 45c937cd78805d7b13b4c43f4bc4888e93a2ff15e787ad4fb41d77b51f837d89
SEED:      20260719

DEFINITION: A (mean of log gaps)
  theta_A = mean over post cells of [log(trade) - log(y_hat_0)]

COLUMNS:
  pair:         Pair identifier
  theta_A:      Definition A effect estimate
  n_post_cells: Number of qualifying post cells

ROWS: 4120
SUBSET: Split-half qualifying pairs (>= 2 cells in each split half)

INV-048 NOTE:
  This file is a successor to T22_theta_A_treated.csv (n=4120), which contained
  only split-half qualifying pairs. S30_moment_power.R required all 4182 treated
  pairs. This file retains the 4120 qualifying pairs for reliability analysis;
  T22_theta_A_all.csv now contains all 4182 treated pairs for S30.

